{"id":"ebfeeba38e32e200","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-pontryagin-class.md","title":"Pontryagin Class","display":"df-pontryagin-class — Pontryagin Class","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-pontryagin-class","aliases":["58-df-pontryagin-class"],"display":"df-pontryagin-class — Pontryagin Class","depends_on":["[[58-df-chern-class]]","[[58-df-complex-vector-bundle]]","[[58-df-vector-bundle]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-pontryagin-class"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-pontryagin-class</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-pontryagin-class — Pontryagin Class"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8ee356c2b76fa7ec\" href=\"?note=8ee356c2b76fa7ec\" title=\"58-df-chern-class\">58-df-chern-class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"97bfaddac2f220a7\" href=\"?note=97bfaddac2f220a7\" title=\"58-df-complex-vector-bundle\">58-df-complex-vector-bundle</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"bb62713ade4dcadf\" href=\"?note=bb62713ade4dcadf\" title=\"58-df-vector-bundle\">58-df-vector-bundle</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E,E_{\\mathbb C},X,p\\in V\">\\(E,E_{\\mathbb C},X,p\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k,r\\in\\omega\">\\(k,r\\in\\omega\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{VectorBundle}_S(\\pi_R,E,\\tau_E,X,\\tau_X,\\mathbb R,r)\">\\(\\mathrm{VectorBundle}_S(\\pi_R,E,\\tau_E,X,\\tau_X,\\mathbb R,r)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ComplexVectorBundle}_S(E_{\\mathbb C},\\pi_C,X,\\tau_{E_{\\mathbb C}},\\tau_X,r)\">\\(\\mathrm{ComplexVectorBundle}_S(E_{\\mathbb C},\\pi_C,X,\\tau_{E_{\\mathbb C}},\\tau_X,r)\\)</span> are the exact real- and complex-bundle predicates</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BundleComplexification}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\">\\(\\mathrm{BundleComplexification}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\)</span> denotes the usual fiberwise complexification relation defined below; bundle isomorphism over <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> is kept at the same explicit metatheoretic boundary as in the Chern-class atom</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ChernClass}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(c,j;E_{\\mathbb C},\\pi_C,X,\\tau_{E_{\\mathbb C}},\\tau_X,r)\">\\(\\mathrm{ChernClass}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(c,j;E_{\\mathbb C},\\pi_C,X,\\tau_{E_{\\mathbb C}},\\tau_X,r)\\)</span> is the exact registered Chern-class relation</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PontryaginClass}_S(p,k;E,E_{\\mathbb C},X)\">\\(\\mathrm{PontryaginClass}_S(p,k;E,E_{\\mathbb C},X)\\)</span> (relation defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bundle\\text{-}complexification}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{BundleComplexification}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n(E_{\\mathbb C},\\pi_C,\\tau_{E_{\\mathbb C}};E,\\pi_R,\\tau_E,X,\\tau_X,r)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{VectorBundle}_S(\\pi_R,E,\\tau_E,X,\\tau_X,\\mathbb R,r)\n\\land\\mathrm{ComplexVectorBundle}_S(E_{\\mathbb C},\\pi_C,X,\\tau_{E_{\\mathbb C}},\\tau_X,r)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\operatorname{BundleIsoOver}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\bigl(E_{\\mathbb C},E\\otimes_{\\mathbb R}\\mathbb C;X\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bundle\\text{-}complexification}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{BundleComplexification}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n(E_{\\mathbb C},\\pi_C,\\tau_{E_{\\mathbb C}};E,\\pi_R,\\tau_E,X,\\tau_X,r)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{VectorBundle}_S(\\pi_R,E,\\tau_E,X,\\tau_X,\\mathbb R,r)\n\\land\\mathrm{ComplexVectorBundle}_S(E_{\\mathbb C},\\pi_C,X,\\tau_{E_{\\mathbb C}},\\tau_X,r)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\operatorname{BundleIsoOver}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\bigl(E_{\\mathbb C},E\\otimes_{\\mathbb R}\\mathbb C;X\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pontryagin\\text{-}class}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{PontryaginClass}_S(p,k;E,E_{\\mathbb C},X)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow k\\in\\omega\\land\n\\exists\\pi_R,\\pi_C,\\tau_E,\\tau_{E_{\\mathbb C}},\\tau_X,c\\in V\\;\\exists r\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{BundleComplexification}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n(E_{\\mathbb C},\\pi_C,\\tau_{E_{\\mathbb C}};E,\\pi_R,\\tau_E,X,\\tau_X,r)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{47mm}\\land\n\\mathrm{ChernClass}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n(c,2k;E_{\\mathbb C},\\pi_C,X,\\tau_{E_{\\mathbb C}},\\tau_X,r)\n\\land p=(-1)^k c\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pontryagin\\text{-}class}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{PontryaginClass}_S(p,k;E,E_{\\mathbb C},X)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow k\\in\\omega\\land\n\\exists\\pi_R,\\pi_C,\\tau_E,\\tau_{E_{\\mathbb C}},\\tau_X,c\\in V\\;\\exists r\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{BundleComplexification}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n(E_{\\mathbb C},\\pi_C,\\tau_{E_{\\mathbb C}};E,\\pi_R,\\tau_E,X,\\tau_X,r)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{47mm}\\land\n\\mathrm{ChernClass}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n(c,2k;E_{\\mathbb C},\\pi_C,X,\\tau_{E_{\\mathbb C}},\\tau_X,r)\n\\land p=(-1)^k c\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The real bundle <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> is now tied to the chosen complex bundle <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_{\\mathbb C}\">\\(E_{\\mathbb C}\\)</span> by an explicit metatheoretic complexification relation; previously <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> did not occur in the defining formula.</li>\n<li>The component <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_{2k}\">\\(c_{2k}\\)</span> is obtained through the exact eight-place Chern-class relation rather than an unregistered unary class operator.</li>\n<li>Hirzebruch signature theorem: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau(X) = \\langle \\mathcal{L}(X), [X]\\rangle\">\\(\\tau(X) = \\langle \\mathcal{L}(X), [X]\\rangle\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Pontryagin numbers are invariants of smooth closed manifolds.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-chern-class","status":"resolved","id":"8ee356c2b76fa7ec","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-chern-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-complex-vector-bundle","status":"resolved","id":"97bfaddac2f220a7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-complex-vector-bundle]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-vector-bundle","status":"resolved","id":"bb62713ade4dcadf","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-vector-bundle]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"E,E_{\\mathbb C},X,p\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"k,r\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{VectorBundle}_S(\\pi_R,E,\\tau_E,X,\\tau_X,\\mathbb R,r)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ComplexVectorBundle}_S(E_{\\mathbb C},\\pi_C,X,\\tau_{E_{\\mathbb C}},\\tau_X,r)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BundleComplexification}_{\\mathsf{meta}}","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ChernClass}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(c,j;E_{\\mathbb C},\\pi_C,X,\\tau_{E_{\\mathbb C}},\\tau_X,r)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PontryaginClass}_S(p,k;E,E_{\\mathbb C},X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bundle\\text{-}complexification}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{BundleComplexification}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n(E_{\\mathbb C},\\pi_C,\\tau_{E_{\\mathbb C}};E,\\pi_R,\\tau_E,X,\\tau_X,r)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{VectorBundle}_S(\\pi_R,E,\\tau_E,X,\\tau_X,\\mathbb R,r)\n\\land\\mathrm{ComplexVectorBundle}_S(E_{\\mathbb C},\\pi_C,X,\\tau_{E_{\\mathbb C}},\\tau_X,r)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\n\\operatorname{BundleIsoOver}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\bigl(E_{\\mathbb C},E\\otimes_{\\mathbb R}\\mathbb C;X\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pontryagin\\text{-}class}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{PontryaginClass}_S(p,k;E,E_{\\mathbb C},X)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow k\\in\\omega\\land\n\\exists\\pi_R,\\pi_C,\\tau_E,\\tau_{E_{\\mathbb C}},\\tau_X,c\\in V\\;\\exists r\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{BundleComplexification}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n(E_{\\mathbb C},\\pi_C,\\tau_{E_{\\mathbb C}};E,\\pi_R,\\tau_E,X,\\tau_X,r)\\\\\n&\\hspace{47mm}\\land\n\\mathrm{ChernClass}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n(c,2k;E_{\\mathbb C},\\pi_C,X,\\tau_{E_{\\mathbb C}},\\tau_X,r)\n\\land p=(-1)^k c\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"E","display":false},{"tex":"E_{\\mathbb C}","display":false},{"tex":"E","display":false},{"tex":"c_{2k}","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau(X) = \\langle \\mathcal{L}(X), [X]\\rangle","display":false}],"bytes":2609,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-965","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-pontryagin-class.md|58-df-pontryagin-class]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["8ee356c2b76fa7ec","97bfaddac2f220a7","bb62713ade4dcadf"]}